<title>POLAND: Kety Q4 net rises to PLN 6.8 mln.</title>
<headline>Kety Q4 net rises to PLN 6.8 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kety results for the fourth</p>
<p>quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 8.10 vs    6.52</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  10.12 vs    6.83</p>
<p>    net profit				 6.81 vs    2.99</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Zaklady Metali Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				106.62 vs   93.98</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 102.00 vs   56.10</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.01 vs    0.01 loss</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.31 vs    3.75</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.07</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     4.63 vs   17.30</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.62 vs   17.00</p>
<p>    investment				30.07 vs    2.31</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit			40.66 vs   40.04</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  48.65 vs   38.38</p>
<p>    net profit				29.44 vs   23.78</p>
<p>    net sales				393.09 vs  377.13</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 329.94 vs  298.90</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.01 vs    0.49 loss</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				19.21 vs   13.91</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.70</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    15.69 vs   20.39</p>
<p>    financial costs			  7.71 vs   21.57</p>
<p>    investment				46.81 vs    7.55</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
